sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Pegawai as "Pegawai"
    participant View as "Web View (employee.attendance.check-in)"
    participant Controller as "Employee AttendanceController"
    participant Model as "Attendance Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Pegawai->>View: Isi form lalu klik Check-in
    View->>Controller: POST /employee/attendance/check-in
    Controller->>Controller: Validasi lokasi, foto, status, lampiran
    Controller->>Model: Proses checkIn(data)
    Model->>DB: INSERT attendance + photo + attachment
    DB-->>Model: Data check-in tersimpan
    Model-->>Controller: Check-in berhasil

    alt Data valid (worker valid, belum check-in, lolos aturan)
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi check-in berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (worker tidak ada/sudah check-in/libur/validasi gagal)
        Controller->>View: Back/redirect + error
        View-->>Pegawai: Notifikasi gagal check-in
    end
